# blank
# a check, not a picture of the manual (3.0.1): over the FIRST window the Path Mappings fields take keys as the system
# sends them, and the menu's Select All reaches the field (the word typed after it replaces the first)
size 1280 800
wait 1
menu PathMappings
wait 0.8
click 380 690
wait 0.5
oskey Wrong
wait 0.3
oskey cmd+a
wait 0.3
oskey Projects
wait 0.5
click 600 279
wait 0.3
oskey /Volumes/Projects
wait 0.5
shot check-maps-typing
quit
